{"parse":{"title":"个性/泪影马戏","pageid":6273,"revid":14476,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E6%B3%AA%E5%BD%B1%E9%A9%AC%E6%88%8F&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E6%B3%AA%E5%BD%B1%E9%A9%AC%E6%88%8F&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E6%B3%AA%E5%BD%B1%E9%A9%AC%E6%88%8F&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>泪影马戏</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.B3.AA.E5.BD.B1.E9.A9.AC.E6.88.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"泪影马戏\"><b>泪影马戏</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 泪影马戏.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/98/nejpvc4os7t3feybhphpmg8d9kbxx8p.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E6%B3%AA%E5%BD%B1%E9%A9%AC%E6%88%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/98/nejpvc4os7t3feybhphpmg8d9kbxx8p.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E6%B3%AA%E5%BD%B1%E9%A9%AC%E6%88%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/98/nejpvc4os7t3feybhphpmg8d9kbxx8p.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />泪影马戏\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦物防提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。拥有光环，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"持续伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">持续伤害</font></span></span>]提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦被敌人攻击后，获得1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"隐忍\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">隐忍</font></span></span>]。<br />被敌人攻击后，强制选中自身范围3格最近<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名敌人，对其施加物攻值<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"生命流失\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">生命流失</font></span></span>]，持续2回合（若目标只有<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名，则改为施加物攻值<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"生命流失\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">生命流失</font></span></span>]），最后对目标施加1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"感染\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">感染</font></span></span>]，本效果每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B3%A2%E5%A5%87%E8%8C%B8%E8%8C%B8\" title=\"角色图鉴库/波奇茸茸\"><img alt=\"头像 波奇茸茸.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/37/q51rvg82quelf4ea0wzjspaxxuti251.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">波奇茸茸</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦物防提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。拥有光环，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"持续伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">持续伤害</font></span></span>]提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦被敌人攻击后，获得1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"隐忍\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">隐忍</font></span></span>]。<